WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:04,560
No, no, no, immortal brothers

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,960
Brother, was he joking with you just now?

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,200
One piece of front leg meat weighs one pound

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,000
Ritual books cost one yuan and five yuan on the road.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,160
Two pieces of rabbit skin each

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,200
This is the highest price the commune can offer.

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:17,220
If there are more brothers, I will have to pay for the process.

8
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,540
Forty-eight pounds of front legs

9
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,110
Twelve pounds of ritual books

10
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,470
Forty-eight yuan for front legs

11
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:30,630
Eighteen yuan for ritual books

12
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,070
Plus road head rabbit skin

13
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:33,390
A total of seventy-five yuan

14
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:38,920
Isn’t this immortality?

15
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,800
I stole something from home again today and sold it. Let’s talk about it first.

16
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,040
We no longer sell umbrella wine here.

17
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:49,250
If you don’t have money, don’t come here to get money. Girls from the Su family, don’t avoid your man.

18
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:51,370
It must have been chewed by wolves until not even the bones were left.

19
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:54,170
What are you doing, girl, guarding a broken house?

20
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,410
If you let me go in and warm you up tonight,

21
00:00:56,770 --> 00:00:59,050
Tomorrow I will put in a few nice words for you in front of Brother Zhao.

22
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:01,250
Maybe I can leave you a way to survive.

23
00:01:08,330 --> 00:01:09,930
So damn shameless

24
00:01:10,130 --> 00:01:12,050
I have to go in and taste the immortality today
